<h2 class="archive-refresh-title">Cover and pages</h2>
<p class="archive-refresh-hint">
    Reads again the number of pages and the cover of your digital books from their archive: the cover is the first page.
    Values found on the web replace neither of them.
</p>

<div class="archive-refresh">
    <button type="button" class="archive-refresh-button" disabled="@_isStarting" @onclick="StartAsync">
        @(_isStarting ? "Starting…" : "Refresh cover and pages")
    </button>
</div>
